  "No compras Bitcoin, ETH ni SOL. Tu dinero sigue en USDC: solo predices si el precio subirá o bajará durante el tiempo de la ronda.": "You don't buy Bitcoin, ETH or SOL. Your money stays in USDC: you only predict whether the price goes up or down during the round.",
  "Tiempo definido": "Set time",
  "Cada ronda dura 5 minutos, 15 minutos o 4 horas. Al terminar, se compara el precio final con el precio de inicio.": "Each round lasts 5 minutes, 15 minutes or 4 hours. At the end, the final price is compared with the starting price.",
