  "Cada contrato ganador paga 1.00 USDC. Si lo compraste a 0.55 y aciertas, ganas 0.45 por contrato.": "Each winning contract pays 1.00 USDC. If you bought at 0.55 and you're right, you earn 0.45 per contract.",
